<h1>Jenny Schaffer</h1>
<p>19th Police District Council, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.19thtogether.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (19thtogether.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Launched her reelection campaign in September 2026 on a slate with fellow council member Sam Schoenburg and newcomer Ridge Knapp. The slate&#39;s stated goals are modernizing the approach to public safety, improving police transparency and accountability, promoting responsible, fair and effective policing, elevating the community&#39;s voice, and supporting a strong Community Commission for Public Safety and Accountability.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>19th District Council member since 2023; former special education teacher and North Center parent of three CPS students; co-leads her synagogue&#39;s Public Safety Justice Team.</p>
